### Token de un usuario de desarrollo (mto-platform, apply-partials.sh con usuarios): usuarios.responsable / local
# @name token
POST http://auth.mto.local:8082/realms/mto/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=mto-frontend&username=usuarios.responsable&password=local

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Buscar usuarios (directo al servicio; por el gateway: http://localhost:8090/api/users?search=...)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users?search=almacen&enabled=true&first=0&max=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: http-file-001

### Buscar por atributo (repetible; con 'search' o con la clave repetida responde 400 SEARCH-400)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users?attribute=departamento:operaciones&attribute=turno:noche&max=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear usuario con contrasena temporal
# @name createUser
POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ana.nueva",
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Nueva",
  "email": "ana.nueva@mto.local",
  "emailVerified": true,
  "temporaryPassword": "Cambiame.123",
  "requiredActions": ["UPDATE_PASSWORD"]
}

> {% client.global.set("userId", response.body.id); %}

### Detalle
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modificar datos basicos (lo que no viene se conserva)
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lastName": "Nueva Probada",
  "attributes": {"departamento": ["operaciones"]}
}

### Deshabilitar
PATCH http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/enabled
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": false}

### Contrasena temporal
POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"password": "Otra.Temporal.456", "temporary": true}

### Correo con acciones requeridas (necesita SMTP en el realm; sin el, 502)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/execute-actions-email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"actions": ["UPDATE_PASSWORD", "VERIFY_EMAIL"], "lifespanSeconds": 3600}

### Clientes cuyos roles se pueden asignar
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/roles/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Roles de un cliente
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/roles/clients/mto-stock-api
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Quien tiene un rol de cliente (solo asignaciones directas: los perfiles no se expanden)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/roles/clients/mto-stock-api/stock-read/users?first=0&max=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Roles asignados directamente al usuario
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Asignar roles de cliente
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/roles/clients/mto-stock-api
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roles": ["stock-read", "stock-write"]}

### Quitar roles de cliente (los nombres van en el cuerpo)
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/roles/clients/mto-stock-api
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roles": ["stock-write"]}

### Perfiles disponibles (roles compuestos de realm mto-*)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Que concede un perfil
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/profiles/mto-maintenance-manager
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Quien tiene un perfil
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/profiles/mto-warehouse-viewer/users?first=0&max=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Asignar un perfil
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/profiles/mto-warehouse-viewer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Perfiles del usuario
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Quitar un perfil
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/profiles/mto-warehouse-viewer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sesiones abiertas del usuario
# @name sessions
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {% client.global.set("sessionId", response.body[0] ? response.body[0].id : ""); %}

### Cerrar una sesion (404 SES-404 si no es de ese usuario)
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cerrar todas las sesiones (idempotente; deshabilitar NO cierra las ya abiertas)
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sesiones offline (tokens con offline_access: no salen arriba ni las cierra el DELETE anterior)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/offline-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cerrar todas las sesiones offline (deshabilitar al usuario NO las revoca)
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/offline-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Credenciales del usuario (sin secretos: id, tipo, etiqueta y fecha)
# @name credentials
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {% client.global.set("credentialId", response.body[0] ? response.body[0].id : ""); %}

### Quitar una credencial (el caso real: el otp de quien ha perdido el movil)
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/credentials/{{credentialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrar
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/v1/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
